---
/*
DIRECTION CONTRACT
THESIS: The site is an engineering document that demonstrates the craft it
sells; it refuses the dark-SaaS hero with floating gradients and stat cards.
OWN-WORLD: German drawing-office — graphite ground, paper text, ONE signal-
orange line, steel hairlines, DIN-style frame coordinates, Fragment Mono
annotations, Archivo-expanded display. Recognizable with all content removed
as a technical schematic on a dark drawing board.
STORY: A Geschäftsführer sees their own chaos (Excel, E-Mail, ERP) literally
converge through klarfluss into one clean flowing line → books an Erstgespräch.
FIRST VIEWPORT: kicker, two-line display H1, subline, CTA pair; below, the
full-width working schematic draws itself; hairline annotation row closes.
FORM: Signal-flow schematic (P&ID tradition), pinned by docs/02-brand.md —
brief-pinned world, no concept roll.
*/
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<Layout lang="de" path="/">
  <Header lang="de" path="/" />
  <main id="main">
    <Hero lang="de" />
  </main>
</Layout>
